# Marfa/vikunja fork only

This workspace is the **Marfa fork**, not upstream Vikunja.

## Remotes and PRs

- **Allowed remote:** `https://github.com/Marfa/vikunja` (`origin`)
- Push, PR, and release only against `Marfa/vikunja`
- **Never** add/push to upstream Vikunja (`go-vikunja/vikunja`, `vikunja/vikunja`, code.vikunja.io, or similar)
- **Never** open a PR from this fork into upstream Vikunja unless the user explicitly asks for that in the same message

## When the user says "push" / "залей" / "создай PR"

Default target is `Marfa/vikunja`. Do not ask whether to contribute upstream.

## If upstream appears as a remote

Do not push to it. Warn once and use `origin` → Marfa only.
